jpeg/mr5ikFzletRrQKUnNCOArQXCDGKcU1k6uuoRK7rqESs\"/><figcaption>TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181614271444815872152069.jpeg/wRyS0saAb761MWIhYLgiE_WoO7foWTTIAqjajgKo2o4\"/><figcaption>TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181614273923780608296054.jpeg/0buBQU4jf4pwapcWbGfsXSeyfTJNFZUlJ03JwydNycM\"/><figcaption>TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181614277044473856703852.jpeg/xg52tytbDPQ7NaIPEhTvb4cxfP2iYN6zfiQiFH4kIhQ\"/><figcaption>TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181614280290996224238197.jpeg/fyAPusNlbisq6TSwGuzdqU2U19pomlBQCxgWTgsYFk4\"/><figcaption>TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181614282774155264298067.jpeg/Hde300sxMerj0ZVpQXbR8LLXU_vmGaqnc0z7I3NM-yM\"/><figcaption>TWICE成員周子瑜（IG@thinkaboutzu）</figcaption></figure><p>韓國考試防作弊出奇招！3度發災難警報抓手機　李在明下令改革</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:29:42.510377+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2693,"images":28,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:18:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:48.887566+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:23:18.512166+00:00","content_hash":"70fbcdc781ed491e3853084452f0f7b0896e47722a8955208751bd846122abe3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}